"""Golden test: the MI events export must not change (spec 012, plan note 1).

Spec 012 moves the MI export out of `app.py` / `table_service.py` and into the
`mci` study module (`flask_backend/models/studies/mci.py`). These tests pin:

* the exact CSV bytes `GET /api/events/export` produces for fixed sample rows
  on an `mci` deployment; and
* the export SQL text, captured verbatim from
  `table_service.get_events_export_rows` before the move.

Both were captured from the pre-012 code. If either changes, the move altered
the MI export, which Principle III forbids.
"""

